! _POC-XRUMPLS RT05(IOL 17.15)= アクセスの PE。お客さま B の 10.50/16 は BGP だけで広告する想定(BGP は PoC の段で足す)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.15 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis ACCESS
!
interface Loopback100
 description CUSTOMER-B (advertised in BGP only)
 ip address 10.50.0.1 255.255.0.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description ACCESS to RT04
 ip address 10.0.45.15 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis ACCESS
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis ACCESS
 net 49.0002.0100.0000.0015.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
